Package: libtfel-5.2.0
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: numerical library for material laws (shared libraries)
 TFEL is a numerical library developped by CEA and EDF. It provides
 the infrastructure to implement material knowledge (material
 properties, mechanical behaviours, heat transfer laws, etc.) in a way
 which is independent from any solver.
 .
 Material laws written with the MFront domain specific languages are
 translated into C++ code built on top of the TFEL library.
 .
 This package contains the shared libraries of TFEL and of the tools
 (MFront, MTest) built on top of it.

